1. System Overview & Tech Stack
Minbar Backend is a NestJS 10 RESTful and real-time backend engine for an Educational / Learning Management System (LMS). It handles course authoring, media delivery, interactive assessment engines, student progress tracking, real-time discussions, and administrative oversight.
Tech Stack Summary
* Framework: NestJS 10 (TypeScript 5.1, Node.js 18)
* Database: MongoDB via Mongoose 8
* Authentication: JWT Strategy + Passport (passport-jwt, passport-local), Argon2 password hashing
* Real-Time Communication: Socket.IO (@nestjs/websockets, @nestjs/platform-socket.io)
* API Documentation: Swagger/OpenAPI available at /api
* Media & File Storage: AWS S3 (aws-sdk)
* Email Delivery: SendGrid (@sendgrid/mail) & Nodemailer (@nestjs-modules/mailer)
* Background Tasks: @nestjs/schedule (Cron jobs & timed tasks)
* Security & Middleware: Helmet, CORS, Throttler (Rate Limiting), Mongo Sanitize

