1. Project Overview
Purpose
Minbar is a Learning Management System (LMS) designed to provide an end-to-end online learning platform for administrators, tutors, and learners. The platform enables course creation, learning management, assessments, user management, and progress tracking.
Objectives
* Deliver online learning content efficiently.
* Enable administrators to manage courses, users, tutors, and platform settings.
* Allow tutors to evaluate learner submissions.
* Provide learners with an interactive learning experience through videos, assessments, discussions, and certifications.

