* Course Management
* Gradebook Management
* Question Bank Management
* Tutor Evaluation
* User Management
* Admin Management
* Role Management
* Feedback & Reviews Management
* Notifications
* System Settings

2.2 Tutor
Responsible for evaluating learner submissions.
Responsibilities
* Evaluate Essay Questions
* Evaluate Short Answer Questions
* Review Assignments
* Review Projects
* Publish Marks
Note: Objective question types (MCQ, True/False, Fill in the Blank, etc.) are automatically evaluated by the system.

2.3 Learner
Responsible for enrolling and completing courses.
Features
* Explore Courses
* Enroll in Courses
* Complete Learning Modules
* Participate in Discussions
* Attempt Assessments
* Track Progress
* Download Certificates
* Submit Feedback & Reviews

