26. Conclusion
Minbar is a comprehensive Learning Management System that enables administrators to manage educational content, tutors to evaluate learner performance, and learners to access structured learning resources, complete assessments, participate in discussions, track progress, and earn certificates. The application follows a modular architecture with React.js on the frontend, NestJS/Node.js on the backend, MongoDB as the database, AWS S3 for file storage, JWT for secure authentication, and SendGrid for email notifications.
